    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Golf is a modern, clean, and responsive WordPress theme designed for golf clubs, golf courses, golf academies, tournaments, coaches, and golf-related businesses. With its elegant design and flexible layout options, ST Golf helps you create a professional online presence to showcase your golf course, club facilities, events, tournaments, membership plans, services, and team. The theme is built with a focus on usability, performance, and mobile-friendly design. The theme has a Modern and professional golf-focused design, which is Easy to customise and update according to your branding. Whether you run a prestigious golf club, a local golf course, a golf training academy, or a professional golf coaching business, ST Golf provides the essential foundation to build a beautiful and engaging WordPress website. Create a professional golfing experience online with ST Golf."
    },
